    airo:evidenceText "“Heavy intervention is needed by the ministry. Must be told in plain words that access to the Indian market is based on rule of law. Follow the rules or ship out,” Suchit Ahuja, an assistant professor at Concordia University, wrote in response to Chandrasekhar’s report on LinkedIn." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3553" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/094167be1cbd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google pauses ‘absurdly woke’ Gemini AI chatbot’s image tool after backlash over historically inaccurate pictures" ;
