<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0dfeac6f9b80> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google has been racing to produce AI software rivaling what the Microsoft-backed company had introduced." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3577" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/10dbdb33d973> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Wednesday night, Elon Musk chimed in on the politically charged debate by posting a cartoon depicting AI progress as having two paths, one with \"Maximum truth-seeking\" on one side (next to an xAI logo for his company) and \"Woke Racist\" on the other, beside logos for OpenAI and Gemini." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3515" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/13a2bffe39c7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Gemini users this week posted screenshots on social media of historically white-dominated scenes with racially diverse characters that they say it generated, leading critics to raise questions about whether the company is overcorrecting for the risk of racial bias in its AI model." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3578" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/13bb83a35f10> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Former Google employee Debarghya Das said, 'It's embarrassingly hard to get Google Gemini to acknowledge that white people exist.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3552" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/150ec5290376> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google on Saturday admitted to Fox News Digital that a failure by its AI chatbot to outright condemn pedophilia is both \"appalling and inappropriate\" and a spokesperson vowed changes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3554" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/16e674d81f5c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google to pause Gemini AI model's image generation of people due to inaccuracies" ;
