<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1a5fb38c1a82> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Shares in Google’s parent company Alphabet fell more than 4% in trading Monday, reflecting investor concern about the potential impact of the controversy on the search company’s new business push." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3513" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1cbdf3ddf8da> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Prabhakar Raghavan, senior vice president of Google's Knowledge & Information, wrote on Friday on Google's product blog." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3574" .

